Subject: host: create custom providers and fetch their models from the web client

Why: the web wizard could not save a bring-your-own-key provider such as
DeepSeek. Adds the create and models-fetch channels, reusing the Desktop provider
handlers (platform bindings split into providerHandlers.desktop.ts). Same code as
the upstream PR branch feat/host-custom-providers, merged after 0006.
Upstream: issue https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues/10644, PR https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/11050
Remove when: the PR is merged and upstream.lock moves past it.

